WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.000
Sam fixes pipes better than anyone in town.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A customer has a leak. She doesn't ask Sam. She asks an engine.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.500
The engines can't read him or confirm him. They name someone else.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:23.000
We fix what engines read, what others confirm, what people choose.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Same question. Now the answer is Sam.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Relevance = Read × Confirm × Choose. Be the answer.
